OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fans pay tribute to crash
OL,4,Adeath officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans and players have paid
OL,7,Ftribute to two Cleveland Police
OL,8,Fofficers who were killed in a crash on
OL,9,FTeesside.
OL,11,FPC Matthew Blades and PC Tom Clough
OL,12,Fdied in a head-on collision between
OL,13,Ftheir police car and a vehicle going
OL,14,Fthe wrong way on the A66 near
OL,15,FMiddlesbrough early on 22 August - five
OL,16,Fpeople in the other vehicle also died.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
